{
  "slug": "save-to-spotify",
  "name": "Save To Spotify",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Create polished audio episodes with TTS narration, rich timelines, cover images, and save them to Spotify via the save-to-spotify CLI.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `configure-chapter-skip` (Configure chapter-skip playback on a Save to Spotify show — the player's skip buttons jump between chapters instead…), `save-to-spotify` (Create polished audio content and save to Spotify).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install save-to-spotify@claude-plugins-official` from `spotify/save-to-spotify` (`plugin`).",
